Added the XML property from :rfc:`6321#section-4.2`. Previously, it was parsed as an unknown value, and xCal elements in other namespaces became incorrect properties. Now, its TEXT value is a :class:`~icalendar.prop.xml.vXml`, which is written as the XML element in xCal. Use :attr:`Component.XML <icalendar.cal.component.Component.XML>` to access it in any component. I used Claude Opus 5.5 to investigate and draft this change under my direction, and I take responsibility for reviewing and validating it. @Sufiyan-MSA
